  "title": "Process Pamphlets",
  "description": "Each issue of Process Pamphlets presents a single project from start to finish. Through emails, sketches, screenshots, drafts, and a first-person running narration, each issue aims to transparently show how things are made in the world; how people find work, initiate projects, organize, communicate, collaborate, negotiate, experiment, make, iterate, edit, distribute, document, and share.\nDesigned and edited by Ben Denzer. Published as open editions\nat Parsons CD.",
